# HIGH PERMISSIVE .gitignore - Maximum file inclusion for uploads
# Only ignores the most essential system/runtime files
# Best for initial repository setup when you want everything included

# OS Files (always ignore)
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python Runtime Only (minimal exclusions)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Environment Variables (security)
.env

# EVERYTHING ELSE IS INCLUDED:
# ✓ All .py files (source code)
# ✓ All .sh files (shell scripts)
# ✓ All .md files (documentation)
# ✓ All .txt files (requirements, etc.)
# ✓ All configuration files
# ✓ All other project files

# Use this for initial uploads, then switch to more restrictive version
